# Duration-free central numerators in the normalized shape

Write `x = 12/5 + u` and `a = 1 + e(5x-8)/12`.
The order region becomes `u ≥ 0`, `0 ≤ e ≤ 1`.
The integer rows below are the coefficients in `u` of the three cleared
numerators, multiplied by `12^7 * 5^18` to clear the constant denominators.
The expansion identities connect every row to the factored residual.
-/

